OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands' ferry service
OL,4,Acancels key route
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlderney Ferry Service Ltd has
OL,7,Fcancelled its scheduled Guernsey route
OL,8,Ffor 2027 after an "exceptionally
OL,9,Fchallenging" 2026 season, bosses say.
OL,11,FIn a post on social media, the company
OL,12,Fsaid it was stopping the route, which
OL,13,Fsaw daily sailings between March and
OL,14,FOctober, due to financial pressures. It
OL,15,Fadded the decision, which had not "been
OL,16,Fan easy one", was due to the global
OL,17,Ffuel crisis and lack of support from
OL,18,Fthe States of Alderney.
OL,20,FIt started the route 2022 to provide a
OL,21,Flink it believed was in "genuine
OL,22,Fdemand".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
