OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands' ferry service
OL,4,Acancels key route
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlderney Ferry Service said it would
OL,7,Fstill be providing sailings to
OL,8,FCherbourg, as well as private charters.
OL,9,FIt did not say if the scheduled route
OL,10,Fmight be reinstated beyond 2027.
